% composition-bridge: Notice how a leader leaves room for a real answer; compare exact echoing with a reply that changes one thing.
% composition-context: Ella Jenkins made participatory call-and-response central to children's music. This tiny original greeting is a listening doorway, not a transcription of her melody or words.
% composition-distance: Original two-note melody, words and form; the named recording is for listening and discussion only. Do not label this as an Ella Jenkins composition.
